{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>A man of faithfulnesses</b> — who does faithfulnesses; he abounds in blessings, meaning that others bless him, or HaShem — and this is correct, and the end of the verse bears witness. <b>But one who hurries</b> — who is quick to grow rich — will not be innocent of harm."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:15.732198849Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}